          "body": "> I asked in the lists some time ago why we have so many repository.xml files and which\n> one is for what. I think now is a good time to ask again :)\n\nI think nobody really knows... Optimally we'd have just a single default repository.xml embedded in jackrabbit-core. All the other components and test suites would use that as the default configuration.",
